** 77 GHz Cross-Coupled VCO
** PDK: IHP SG13G2 (130nm SiGe BiCMOS)
**
** Topology: Cross-coupled npn13G2l differential pair
**   TL resonator (~590µm open stub for λ/4 at 77 GHz)
**   Junction varactor for frequency tuning
**   Target: 72-82 GHz tuning range, <-90 dBc/Hz @ 1MHz offset

.subckt VCO_77G OUTP OUTN VTUNE VCC GND

** === Cross-Coupled Pair ===
** Nx=2 to reduce parasitic capacitance (target higher freq)
XQ1 OUTP OUTN net_tail GND npn13G2l Nx=2 El=2.5u
XQ2 OUTN OUTP net_tail GND npn13G2l Nx=2 El=2.5u

** === TL Resonator Stubs (open-ended) ===
** Real PDK: Nx=2 gives CJE≈10.5fF, CJC≈2fF per HBT → ~25fF per node total
** For 77 GHz with 25fF: need L ≈ 170pH → stub len = 170pH/445.9nH/m = 380µm
** Use 350µm (slightly shorter, choke adds remaining inductance)
XTLRES1 OUTP res1_end GND TL_85_135u
XTLRES2 OUTN res2_end GND TL_85_135u

** === Varactor Tuning ===
Cvar1 OUTP net_var1 3fF
Rvar1 net_var1 VTUNE 10
Cvar2 OUTN net_var2 3fF
Rvar2 net_var2 VTUNE 10

** === Bias ===
Rtail net_tail GND 200

** === DC Feed (TL choke — tuned for 77 GHz) ===
XTLCHK1 VCC OUTP GND TL_85_105u
XTLCHK2 VCC OUTN GND TL_85_105u

** === Supply Decoupling ===
XCD1 VCC GND cap_cmim w=100e-6 l=20e-6 m=1

.ends VCO_77G

** === TL choke (105µm, Z0=85) ===
.subckt TL_85_105u IN OUT GND
* 4-section pi model, each section 26.25µm
* L_sec = 445.9e-9 * 26.25e-6 = 11.71pH
* C_sec = 61.5e-12 * 26.25e-6 = 1.61fF
* R_sec = 22.16e3 * 26.25e-6 = 0.582 Ohm
C1 IN GND 0.805fF
R1 IN n1 0.582
L1 n1 n2 11.71pH
C2 n2 GND 1.61fF
R2 n2 n3 0.582
L2 n3 n4 11.71pH
C3 n4 GND 1.61fF
R3 n4 n5 0.582
L3 n5 n6 11.71pH
C4 n6 GND 1.61fF
R4 n6 n7 0.582
L4 n7 OUT 11.71pH
C5 OUT GND 0.805fF
.ends

** === TL resonator stub (135µm, Z0=85) ===
.subckt TL_85_135u IN OUT GND
* 3-section pi model, each section 45µm
* L_sec = 445.9e-9 * 45e-6 = 20.07pH
* C_sec = 61.5e-12 * 45e-6 = 2.77fF
* R_sec = 22.16e3 * 45e-6 = 0.997 Ohm
C1 IN GND 1.385fF
R1 IN n1 0.997
L1 n1 n2 20.07pH
C2 n2 GND 2.77fF
R2 n2 n3 0.997
L2 n3 n4 20.07pH
C3 n4 GND 2.77fF
R3 n4 n5 0.997
L3 n5 OUT 20.07pH
C4 OUT GND 1.385fF
.ends

