R2 n2 n3 1.025
L2 n3 n4 20.62pH
C3 n4 GND 2.84fF
R3 n4 n5 1.025
L3 n5 n6 20.62pH
C4 n6 GND 2.84fF
R4 n6 n7 1.025
L4 n7 OUT 20.62pH
C5 OUT GND 1.42fF
.ends

